.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH PRINTENV 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
printenv \- Display the values of the specified environment VARIABLE(s), or (with no VARIABLE) display name and value pairs for them all.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBprintenv\fR [OPTION]... [VARIABLE]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Display the values of the specified environment VARIABLE(s), or (with no VARIABLE) display name and value pairs for them all.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-0\fR, \fB\-\-null\fR
end each output line with 0 byte rather than newline
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIvariables\fR]

.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
